title: "[Beslisboom] VoidRequestHandlerPattern.Rewrite" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q1: "Expliciete interface-\nimplementatie?" {shape: diamond}
q2: "Returntype Task\n(ook gekwalificeerd)?" {shape: diamond}
q3: "async?" {shape: diamond}
q4: "Blok-body met\nstatements?" {shape: diamond}
q5: "Elke return / expression body\nTask.CompletedTask?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: explicit interface\n(explicit)"
m2: "Manual: does not return Task"
m3: "Manual: without a statement body\n(async-expression)"
f1: "ValueTask<Unit>; return; → return Unit.Value;\n+ return Unit.Value; als einde bereikbaar\n(async, early-return, throw-at-end)"
f2: "ValueTask<Unit> + Unit.ValueTask\n(completed-task, completed-task-expression)"
m4: "Manual: not Task.CompletedTask\n(other-return)"
q1 -> m1: ja
q1 -> q2: nee
q2 -> m2: nee
q2 -> q3: ja
q3 -> q4: ja
q3 -> q5: nee
q4 -> m3: nee
q4 -> f1: ja
